---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="AI Virtual Company — Agentera" description="Simulate an entire organization as collaborating agents.">
  <article class="prose prose-invert max-w-none">
    <h1>AI Virtual Company</h1>
    <p class="lead">A sandbox to model teams, roles, and workflows as autonomous agents that plan, execute, and report.</p>

    <h2>What it does</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Org graph: roles (CEO, PM, Eng, QA, Legal) with goals and dependencies</li>
      <li>Multi-agent planning (Analyst/Skeptic/Judge) with shared memory</li>
      <li>Live dashboards: tasks, KPIs, incidents</li>
      <li>APIs: plug your data sources (Docs, GitHub, Slack)</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Who it's for</h2>
    <p>Research labs, startups, and enterprise R&D teams needing simulation and decision support.</p>

    <h2>How it works</h2>
    <ol>
      <li>Define org roles and goals</li>
      <li>Connect data and tools</li>
      <li>Run agentic workflows; review plans and outputs</li>
      <li>Export reports and approvals</li>
    </ol>

    <h2>Security & Compliance</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>SOC 2-ready architecture (separation of data and keys)</li>
      <li>Audit logs and redaction policies</li>
      <li>PII handling with masked retrieval</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Roadmap</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Scenario generator (what-if org changes)</li>
      <li>Budget simulator with financial agents</li>
      <li>Human-in-the-loop review queues</li>
    </ul>

    <p class="mt-8"><a class="btn" href="/docs">Read the Docs →</a></p>
  </article>
</Base>